WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Open Library from the sidebar to see your documents.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.300
Click Open. The editor docks next to the chat.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.800
Ask the model to edit it. With a document open, chat switches to Agent so it can write into the document.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.300
The model writes the edit straight into the document.

5
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:18.300
The edit waits for your review. Accept or reject it.

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.700
Click the version badge to see every version with its changes.

7
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.100
Click an older version to preview it, or Restore it as a new version.
